Here's the HTML code for the "Nexus" design concept:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lyralink SaaS</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1em;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        nav li {
            margin-right: 20px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .nexus {
            background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f7f7f7, #333);
            background-size: 100% 300px;
            background-position: 0% 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nodes {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .node {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 20px;
            width: 200px;
            height: 100px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .node h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .node p {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .connections {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .connection {
            background-color: #333;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #fff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 20px;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .connection i {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1em;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <div class="nexus">
        <div class="nodes">
            <div class="node">
                <h2>Welcome to Lyralink SaaS</h2>
                <p>A conversational AI platform that helps you get more done in less time.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="node">
                <h2>Code Debugging</h2>
                <p>Get help with code debugging, optimization, and more.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="node">
                <h2>API Integration</h2>
                <p>Integrate APIs with ease using our platform.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="node">
                <h2>Creative Writing</h2>
                <p>Generate high-quality content with our AI-powered writing tool.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="node">
                <h2>Research and Analysis</h2>
                <p>Get insights and analysis with our data-driven research tool.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="connections">
            <div class="connection">
                <i class="fas fa-link"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="connection">
                <i class="fas fa-link"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="connection">
                <i class="fas fa-link"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="connection">
                <i class="fas fa-link"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="connection">
                <i class="fas fa-link"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2023 Lyralink SaaS</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
